@base = http://localhost:8080

### Login como admin (copie o token da resposta para @token)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@vehiclerental.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### Cadastro de cliente
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cliente@email.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte1",
  "fullName": "Cliente Exemplo",
  "driverLicense": "12345678901",
  "phone": "27999990000"
}

@token = cole-o-token-aqui

### Frota completa
GET {{base}}/api/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Frota filtrada
GET {{base}}/api/vehicles?category=SUV&maxDailyRate=300&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Novo veículo (Admin) — a placa é normalizada pelo domínio
POST {{base}}/api/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plate": "abc-1d99",
  "brand": "Fiat",
  "model": "Argo",
  "year": 2025,
  "category": "Hatch",
  "dailyRate": 110.00
}

### Enviar para manutenção (Admin)
PATCH {{base}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Maintenance"
}

### Perfil do cliente autenticado
GET {{base}}/api/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar reserva de 10 dias (Customer) — aplica 10% de desconto
POST {{base}}/api/rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-10-01",
  "endDate": "2026-10-11"
}

### Aluguéis visíveis para o chamador
GET {{base}}/api/rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Devolução com atraso (Admin) — gera multa
POST {{base}}/api/rentals/{{rentalId}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnDate": "2026-10-14"
}

### Cancelar reserva não iniciada
POST {{base}}/api/rentals/{{rentalId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health
